<title>USA: Tolland ups qtly div to $0.05/shr post split.</title>
<headline>Tolland ups qtly div to $0.05/shr post split.</headline>
<text>
<p>VERNON, Conn, July 22 (Reuter)</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.05		    $0.05</p>
<p> Pay		    Aug 19</p>
<p> Record		  Aug 5</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Toland Bank.</p>
<p>Maintaining the quarterly dividend at five cents per share, representing a 33 percent increase over the preceding quarter after taking into account the recent 4 for 3 stock split.</p>
</text>
